{"product_id":"lie-kill-walk-away","title":"Lie kill walk away","description":"\u003cp\u003eLIE: 'I check the Range Rover dash. The keys are in there. The sirens are closing in. There's a police helicopter coming over the hospital.' KILL: 'I have to decide. Decide right now. I can keep out of trouble. Not get involved. Just run away through the park and go home and pretend none of this has happened. Or I can help Becca.' WALK AWAY: 'I stare into her eyes. Those deep blue eyes. Just for a split second. I tell her, \"get in the car\".' Joe and Becca uncover a deadly secret. A lethal bioweapon is about to be unleashed. Millions will suffer a terrible death. Now they are being hunted down. And their problems have only just begun .. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:20 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Matt Dickinson \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781910240861 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43403647811737,"sku":"9RC9781910240861","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/lie-kill-walk-away-498355.jpg?v=1752150881","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/lie-kill-walk-away","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}